Key Design Decisions
Data Layer
DuckDB as in-memory query engine over Parquet
All gold tables loaded on app startup
Contract validation runs before any analytics
Computation Flow
Load Parquet → Validate Contract → Build DuckDB Views
→ Kit Explosion → Transfer Delays → Netting Ledger
→ Priority Pegging → Blocker Attribution → Stranded Calc
→ Buffer Targets → UI Render + Exports
Scenario Handling
scenario_id from site_readiness drives capacity
Scenario selector on Home page filters all views
Scenario Compare page shows deltas
